 bout Jesus and how to be a Christian!  So we had a long talk about follo
 wing Jesus and prayed - and she just wanted to keep talking about it!  A
 nd then again the next night\, “can we talk more about following Jesus?”
   She has prayed “the prayer” before\, but this was the first time it wa
 s self-motivated and seemed so sincere. Praise God!
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20251008T210000
DTSTAMP:20251010T141347Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20251008T200000
LAST-MODIFIED:20251010T141346Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Livy prayed to receive Jesus 
