BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20140611T162500Z
DESCRIPTION:From LaCrosse\, take hwy 16 north to the corner at the mall (
 Pier 1 and Red Lobster on 	opposite corners).  \nTurn LEFT onto hwy 157 
 at the mall intersection.  \nFollow hwy 157 north over Interstate 90\, w
 here it joins hwy 53.  \nStay in RIGHT LANE (“exit only“ to Main Street)
  to exit down ramp off hwy 157/53.  \nAt light at bottom of exit ramp\, 
 turn RIGHT onto Main Street.  \nAfter right turn onto Main Street\, imme
 diately get into LEFT turn lane (~100 ft.)\nTurn LEFT onto Greens Coulee
  Rd. off of Main Street just before Coulee Golf-bowl.  	(Kwik Trip is im
 mediately on your right on Main Street.  If you go past Kwik 	Trip on Ma
 in Street or if you go past Coulee Golf-bowl on left\, you have gone too
  	far)\n0.9 miles out Greens Coulee Rd. is mailbox on LEFT with 4809 and
  reflectors on post. 	(this driveway is ~250 ft. past the large red barn
  located on the right side of the 	road [Clearwater Farm] and just past 
 it’s animal pens/fencing.  If you drive by the 	retention ponds on the r
 ight you have gone too far!)\nHead up the long driveway! (can not see ho
 use from the road at the bottom)\n\nProblems: phone 781-0270.\n
DTEND;TZID=US/Central:20140626T173000
DTSTAMP:20140626T193003Z
