BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20260423T003313Z
DESCRIPTION:*Weather permitting* NIMBA's weekly group ride on Mondays at 
 6pm at Bonneyville Mill run all summer long.\n\nNon-NIMBA members welcom
 e to join these no-drop rides!\n\nNIMBA group ride leaders will meet you
  in the parking lot prior to the ride. \n\nWhether you're new to mountai
 n biking or a seasoned rider\, our weekly group ride is a perfect way to
 :\n-Ride with people who love dirt\, berms\, and bikes as much as you do
 .\n-Learn about trail etiquette\, local events\, and how NIMBA supports 
 the MTB community in Michiana\n\nNo pressure\, no drop — just fun times\
 , shared lines\, and maybe a few trail tips along the way.\n\nPlus\, you
 ’ll get the inside scoop on how we maintain the trails and grow the ridi
 ng community right here at home.\n\nMeet at the trailhead at 6pm every M
 onday weather permitting.
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260427T193000
DTSTAMP:20260423T003313Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260427T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T003313Z
LOCATION:Bonneyville Mill
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SEQUENCE:0
