BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20260401T135133Z
DESCRIPTION:The meet runs from 9:00 am - 12:45 pm at Bremen High School. 
 We will take a bus leaving from Grissom at 7:30 am and returning around 
 1:30 pm. Please have students come to Grissom at 7:20 a.m. You will need
  to pick up your student from Grissom at 1:30 pm. Both drop off and pick
  up will be by door A in the front of the school. You are welcome to att
 end the meet. Spectators may park in the east lot and enter door 16 (the
  main entrance). The competition will be in gym B. The order of the comp
 etition is social studies\, math\, English\, science and interdisciplina
 ry. The interdisciplinary team consists of one student from each of the 
 subject areas chosen by the coach of that team. Please have your student
  bring a sack lunch to eat when they are not competing. There will also 
 be concessions available for your student to purchase food. Students wil
 l need cash for concessions
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260502T133000
