BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20220212T161638Z
DESCRIPTION:\nPacket Pick Up:\n\n- GOTR Program Participants do NOT need 
 to pick up their packet before Saturday\, May 21 - they will meet with t
 heir groups on the 5K morning. All materials will be together!   They ar
 e asked  wear their program shirts to the event!\n\n- Community particip
 ants\, and  friends and family that are running with program participant
 s can avoid long 5K day lines by coming to Potawatomi Park- Pavilion on 
 Wall Street South Bend\, IN from 3-6pm on Friday\, May 20.\n\nEvent Deta
 ils:\n\n- Join us on the morning of May 21st\, 2022 between 8:30 - 9:15 
 am at Potawatomi Park\, South Bend\, IN to witness the pre- event activi
 ties! \n\n- GOTR Participants need to arrive between 8:30 and 8:45 am in
  order to have time to get ready before the event!\n\n- 5K begins prompt
 ly at 9:30 a.m. [Pre-race announcements at 9:15 am]\n\n- Event day parki
 ng: Visit our website for more information about event day parking. 
