DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a "field trip" to the Elkhart Area Career 
 Center for our January meeting.  All attendees need to RSVP for this mee
 ting by Friday\, December 22nd at noon.  I have added a poll to this inv
 ite with a “Yes” / “No” option to RSVP.\n\n\nMembers should arrive no ea
 rlier than 12:15 (this is pushed back slightly to accommodate the arriva
 l time of their students)\nArrive at Door 1 (Mr. Josiah Parker has marke
 d the door in a Google Maps included in the email)\nThe tour will start 
 and end in the auditorium with a tour of the facilities in between\nMr. 
 Parker and a representative from EACC will be hosting the tour to answer
  any questions\nThe tour will last about 45/60 minutes and no PP present
 ation will be shared
