 son Highway will intersect with Meals\nAve.bove At that intersection tur
 n left and you will see the park. This intersection is\napproximately ha
 lf a block after you pass under the big arch that goes across the\nhighw
 ay. Continue on Meals to North Harbor Drive. Turn left onto North Harbor
  Driv.e\nand come into the entrance.
